d boring country.... Maybe some in the south (ZUid-Limburg) but theyare not interesting. Well, I've got to go continue my schoolwork; I'll see you laterbyebyeDORIEN  **ausus**To: bgsSubj: hiDate: Jan 20HiI'm sorry I haven;t sent you the information yet, but I will go to the trave(travel agency) tomorrow. About the chemistry 'classes' if I may call them thiswasy, for it is too late for me to look up the roght word in the dictionary, My brother has spent many many many hours, trying to make me understandeverything about atoms and other difficult things (of which i don't know theenglish words)) but I still don't get it. It would just be a waste of your timebut thanks for the offer anyway.I'm going to crash now, so I'll catch you later.night hugsDorienP.S: If you mail me back please mail me at my e-mail address: doortje_d@hotmail.com**ausus**To: bgsSubj: hiDate: Jan 22Hi,I went to the tourist infomation place for you, but the flyers I wanted were too expensive for me, so I've found you another solution. You schould check outthe 'NJHC'-site, a special website in Engslish which contains all the info youneed on Dutch youth hostels. Here comes : www.njhc.org/index_en.htmIt's a very useful site with prices, addresses, etc. I hope that will beenough information to get you on your way... Otherwise; feel free to ask me   anything. :)greetz,Dorien**leeloo**To: bgsSubj: ngfDate: Feb  7igazan ne legyen uldozesi maniad, asszem eleg keson leptem be hozza :))meg sajnos a levelirashoz sem van nagyon ihletem :(ooo en szivesen megyek tulelni, a noverkemet viszont raftingolni vidd el :)eva**leeloo**To: bgsSubj: humDate: Feb 13hat kedjuk a szellemiekkel:masik andriskatol sikeresen elkunyiztam a duneketde sajnos nem teljes a sorozat, most epp az angol valtozatot probalgatom :)ami meg a fizikaiakatelvileg satrunk ugye vande csak meg kellett emlegetni a rafting szot, es az anyukam idegbajt kapott :)minden jot, dogolj meg